      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PORANGI MOOSE (1) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by one length at Healesville in a handy 19.66 beating Somerton Willow. Form is hard to fault from this box, with a win and two minor placings from three starts. The one to beat again. FOUND TREASURE (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (24.96) in a Grade 5 at Sale. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. LET IT LINGER (6) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fourth (20.47) at Traralgon in a Grade 5. Key player on best and worth another try. ZIPPING BANGALOW (3) will give backers a sight.",
